{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bdb23f87ad96aeeca6b820d2ac7c081ad90f5a422901334a03a5014e7ff5536a", "ja": "（海での仕事が終わり、海美達はカラーインクの\n水鉄砲で遊んでいた。そろそろ帰る時間だが……）", "zh": "海边的工作结束后，海美她们一直在玩彩色墨水水枪。差不多该回去了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "300d4613454c73c92192f7e8f7eb99754e65a2c225ace3a821032c2a50190302", "ja": "はぁ～……。もう夕方かぁ……。", "zh": "哈啊～……已经傍晚了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b343da6bc87bb1badeba75b3dc77ce2880c8689d26a7f555bbe77a7b28e05daf", "ja": "お疲れ様、海美。\nどうしたんだ？　疲れたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，海美。\n怎么了？累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "97b617c4de343603ea08b6b4f5801d860f73db50362fa38f411ea4242f1301b5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　私はまだまだ\n元気いっぱいだよ！　えっと、そうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！我还精神得很呢！\n呃，不是这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "dfc7eb66ebed030aa438f77af2efe4091274face60f7dd7190de11d3aa2fce8e", "ja": "もう帰る時間なんだなーって思ったら、\nなんだか寂しくなっちゃった……。", "zh": "一想到已经到了要回去的时间，\n就觉得有点舍不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f8c6cee69e8aace1731043f206be60632764c7d76b1255ef60c2ae6714fd7f6a", "ja": "そうだったのか。昼間は、思い切り遊んだからな。\nその分、寂しさも強いのかもな。", "zh": "原来如此。毕竟白天尽情玩了一场。也许正因为这样，才会觉得更寂寞吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "efdd9aa5767933e898203dfb22de8462d71c885d9f3267529243c213d217317d", "ja": "そうだね……。でもね、寂しいのともうひとつ……\n悔しいなーって気持ちもあるの。", "zh": "是啊……不过呢，除了寂寞以外，还有一种……\n觉得好不甘心啊——的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1007_p", "source_sha256": "47f3118c72dc15aaca41cf11487d8703713355ebb3b4080b7e7442ad9787c54f", "ja": "悔しい？", "zh": "不甘心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "6dd9b15648bc6e5dd7e8d288134096ccc901ba4b3c9be64acdee7d022e3084ff", "ja": "うん。本当は他の遊びもしたかったんだ。\nでも、インクを落とすのに時間がかかっちゃって。", "zh": "嗯。其实我还想玩别的游戏的。\n但是洗掉墨水花了不少时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "03e1fc2f5684fccda21ca0fa7a1f67cb3ab725dc34032412eaeb61fabe2fce8a", "ja": "いっぱい遊んだけど、全っ然遊び足りないよーっ！\nううっ、楽しい時間がもっと続けばいいのに……。", "zh": "虽然玩了好多游戏，可还是完全没玩够啊——！\n呜呜，要是快乐的时光能再延长一些就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0b2244a6e23fd04db2301f0abf20a1f553582213dcf445e6ba2b33ef9292d31c", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。……それなら、\n今、海美が思ったことは次回の宿題にしようか。", "zh": "哈哈，说得没错。……既然这样，\n那就把海美刚才想到的事情留作下次的作业吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "3ffc16c9e58a09c0129713eeb9b54e6c5fb8fa6fcda054b08bbdd4d47a501485", "ja": "宿題……？　どういうこと？", "zh": "作业……？　这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4d2386720a592a4427b7f9acf4647f667316b4a73824ab822ee5dfed6d125662", "ja": "今日やり残したことを宿題にしておいて、\n次、海に来たら全力でその宿題をこなす。", "zh": "把今天还没完成的事情留作作业，等下次来海边时再全力完成这份作业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cf49600b6dd3359156026d9149360f4e50b503aa05f85400272a488def995c31", "ja": "楽しみも増えるし、いい案だと思うんだけど。\nどうだろう？", "zh": "乐趣也会增加，我觉得这是个好主意。\n怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "cdd9fcfc6bc85148b3d1c0beb37648fb1ef05dfb3d0fb145a9fcc78da847864a", "ja": "宿題か……うんうん、それいいかも！　\nそしたら、次もいっぱい楽しめるもんねっ☆", "zh": "作业啊……嗯嗯，这主意好像不错！　\n这样一来，下次也能尽情玩个痛快了嘛☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "fa0ef237d6b29247023383551580e3c5beff6c4a9912c6c695decb0387c9ab05", "ja": "私、ぜーったい宿題を終わらせたい！　だから\n{$P$}、また海に連れてきてくれる？", "zh": "我一定要把作业做完！所以\n{$P$}，你能再带我来海边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1016_p", "source_sha256": "84620e9221defbf32e267f8a2fb5b7158bf4e125c720af980a13374c25e8e852", "ja": "もちろん！　みんなのスケジュールを調整して、\n海に行く日をつくっておくよ。", "zh": "当然了！我会协调好大家的日程，\n空出一天去海边的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "94ed076121fc5845409b0fc35fdac91cd6e6f0a03aeb3d0cc326f93e2985b32a", "ja": "やったーっ！　{$P$}、絶対だよ！\n約束だからねっ！", "zh": "太好啦——！{$P$}，一言为定哦！\n说好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "2f07e5865f62faaeec9e8316a276ee5685ee3488933fc77035bb57c96e6ccb75", "ja": "お～～い、海～！！\nまた遊びに来るからね～！！　えへへ♪", "zh": "喂——大海——！！\n我还会再来玩的哦——！！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0343_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a14959a1a8b0809ff17940b3e58ff93ef3ae2c93da6fea4e8ad9ec357858daeb", "ja": "（海美にとって、楽しい思い出になったみたいだな。\n……よし、戻ったらすぐスケジュールの調整だ！）", "zh": "（看来这次给海美留下了快乐的回忆。\n……好，回去后马上调整日程安排！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
